{
    "name": "synthetic-happy",
    "description": "Synthetic (no SURF key held at port time, 2026-09-16): the `{ data, meta }` envelope and the `{ error: { code, message } }` error shape follow the v1 adaptor tests and the v1 design's live-verified upstream contract; the response body shape is the vendor OpenAPI 0.2.97 200 schema (`api.asksurf.ai/gateway/openapi.json`, fetched 2026-09-16); field values are placeholders. Unverified against live traffic — replace via `deno task record`. A 2xx with rows in `data` — the flat 1-credit line settles once; `meta.credits_used` stays in the body (design D1).",
